  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into wedges.\n• Spread wedges over a large microwave-safe plate. Cover with a damp paper towel. Microwave wedges on high, 2 minutes.\n• Drain any excess liquid, then place wedges on a lined oven tray. Sprinkle over All-American spice blend, drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Spread out evenly, then bake until golden and tender, 12-15 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65d29f788f58913391b75305-298d56d5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, place haloumi in a medium bowl and cover with water.\n• Drain sweetcorn. Thinly slice celery and spring onion. Finely chop garlic.\n• Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Cook corn kernels until lightly browned, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a large bowl. TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the kernels are “popping” out.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65d29f788f58913391b75305-ee4d8b91.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• In the last minute of cook time, add garlic and the honey and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• To the bowl with corn, add celery, Dijon mustard and half the mayonnaise. Add slaw mix. Toss to coat. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65d29f788f58913391b75305-219b7369.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide honey garlic haloumi, corn slaw and sweet potato wedges between plates.\n• Garnish with spring onion. Serve with remaining mayonnaise. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65d29f788f58913391b75305-d51feeec.jpeg"
    }
  ]
